// The first time out on the cape: the cliffs, the wing fossils, the
// cottage (Cassius's hand-off is the contract beat south.cassius).

## The cliff path

::bg{location="tidewell-cape" time="day"}
::music{action="start" mood="calm" volume="down"}
@narrator{code="0010"}: Tidewell Cape. The path runs along the top of the cliffs, and the cliffs are striped like a cake: grey, yellow, grey. In the yellow stripe, if you look, there are bones. Stone bones. Wings.
@narrator{code="0020"}: At the very end of the cape stands a cottage with three boats pulled up beside it and a weathervane shaped like a Galewing.
